<html><head><title>Researchers role</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span>Transdisciplinary education is derived from transdisciplinary research, where scientists from various disciplines collaborate with non-academic partners on a 'wicked problem' (OECD, 2020). The research perspective is crucial in transdisciplinary education to guide and ensure the research-driven approach in the project, such as problem identification and the integration of types of knowledge and methods (Klein, 2014).</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span style="font-size: 12px;"><b>References:</b></span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span><span style="font-size: 12px;">Klein, J.T. (2017). Typologies of Interdisciplinarity: The Boundary Work of Definition. In: </span><span style="font-size: 12px;">Frodeman</span><span style="font-size: 12px;">, R. (ed.), </span></span><span style="font-size: 12px;">The Oxford Handbook of Interdisciplinarity, </span><span><span style="font-size: 12px;">2nd edition (pp. 21-34</span><span style="font-size: 12px;">).Oxford</span><span style="font-size: 12px;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12px;"> Handbooks. </span></span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordhb/9780198733522.013.3" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><span style="font-size: 12px;">https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordhb/9780198733522.013.3</span></span></a></p><span style="font-size: 12px;"> </span><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 1em;"><span style="font-size: 12px;">OECD (2021), Embedding Values and Attitudes in Curriculum: Shaping a Better Future, OECD Publishing, Paris, </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1787/aee2adcd-en" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span><span style="font-size: 12px;">https://doi.org/10.1787/aee2adcd-en</span></span></a></p></body></html>